5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I have lived long enough to know that silence breeds resentment. Let us speak plainly about what this house costs us, truly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. The tension around money is already affecting how we talk to each other. Let's be honest about that.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just feel a bit confused. The old rules don't seem to fit us anymore. Can we check if that is actually true?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m not signing anything until I see the actual numbers. I need to know what this really costs before we commit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I worry about who has to keep track of all this. It takes so much time.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Daisuke, your worry is wise. A system that burdens one soul is a system that will eventually break.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
