44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want to know how much time it will take. I don't want to be the one stuck doing it.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, the rooms were handed out by lot, yet the sun favors some. That is not a choice, but a circumstance. We must account for it.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
